From: Jyotiprakash Mishra <mail@jyotiprakash.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 05:51:48 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Tessera javac: ulong casts to long keep the cast; ulong
 to float/double is unsigned; positions on lowered trees

Found by the Tessera javac test suite (tessera-eval/javac-tests): (long) of a
ulong expression stayed ulong, (double) of a ulong converted it as signed, and
errors on lowered trees were reported at line 1.
---
 .../com/sun/tools/javac/comp/TesseraSyntax.java | 17 ++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 16 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/comp/TesseraSyntax.java b/src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/comp/TesseraSyntax.java
